type: software
title: "DEDUCT: Deep DNA Sequence Compression by Using Orthogonal Transform Network Layers"
abstract: "Reference-free, constructively lossless compression of genome collections: contig separation, rotation- and strand-invariant FFT clustering, consensus alignment, and a per-cluster convolutional autoencoder with a vertical block-DCT bottleneck."
